3. `bdc <bead-id> <the files you changed>` — this runs the gate, makes the
   tagged pathspec commit, and closes the bead. It does not push; do not push.

## Step 4 — build report (the manager's evidence; a wrong name or field fails the audit)
Write `work/w3_atomic-claim/builds/bd-ok4pr.3.2.1786118144677961643.build.json`,
one JSON object:

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
